中文条款
========

1. 范围
本许可证适用于以本许可证提供的 Lychee Talent 代码、文档及原创素材（“本作品”），
且仅限于权利人有权授予的权利。明确标注其他授权的文件、第三方素材及游戏
厂商内容不因本许可证而被重新授权，其原有条款继续适用。本许可证不撤销
已经依据其他许可证合法取得的权利。法律另行赋予且不可排除的权利不受影响。

2. 免费使用与私人修改
遵守本许可证时，你可以为非商业用途免费、非独占地下载、运行、复制和研究
本作品，并为个人非商业用途修改本作品。除第 3、5 条外，本许可证不授予
公开发布、分发或提供修改版及衍生作品的权利。

3. 完整原版分发
你可以免费、非商业地分发完整、未经修改的官方源码或官方插件安装目录，
也可以将完整、未经修改的插件包含在免费、非商业的整合包中。压缩格式和
外层目录的调整不视为修改，但必须满足全部条件：
  a. 保留 Lychee Talent / 荔枝天赋名称、作者及已有版权和授权声明；
  b. 随分发内容附上本许可证全文及适用的第三方声明；
  c. 在分发页面、整合包说明或其他接收者容易看到的位置明确标注：
     “Lychee Talent（荔枝天赋）— Follen · https://github.com/Follen/LycheeTalent”；
     或对应英文：“Lychee Talent — Follen · https://github.com/Follen/LycheeTalent”；
  d. 不得收取插件、下载、访问或包含它的整合包的费用；
  e. 不得暗示分发者是本作品的原创作者、官方维护者或获得作者背书。

4. 禁止商用与冒名
未经相关权利人事先书面许可，不得为商业目的使用、复制、修改、分发本作品，
或将其用于付费插件、付费整合包、订阅、收费访问、以本作品为交付内容的收费
服务或与其分发挂钩的广告变现。
不得移除或篡改作者、版权、许可和来源信息，不得将本作品或复制了其受版权
保护内容的衍生作品宣称为自己的独立原创作品。改名、换标识或少量代码修改
不会免除上述义务。禁止通过单独抽取本作品的受版权保护内容来规避本条款。
除第 5 条外，公开发布修改版、移植版或衍生作品需要事先取得书面许可，即使
该发布是免费且有署名的。

5. 贡献与独立 Provider
仅为向本项目提出改进、供作者审查而公开的非商业 Fork、分支和补丁，可以
包含修改，但必须保留本许可证和署名，明确标明非官方、标记修改，并且不得
将其宣传或分发为独立产品、替代发行版。此例外不自动允许其他用途的改版发布。
你只可提交自己有权授权的内容。主动提交供本项目合入的原创贡献，表示允许
本项目按本许可证使用、修改及分发该贡献；贡献者保留自身版权。
独立编写、仅调用公开 Provider API、没有复制本作品受版权保护内容的第三方
插件，不因接口调用本身受到本许可证的分发限制。

6. 其他权利与终止
未明确授予的权利由各权利人保留。本许可证不授予商标背书或重新许可本作品
的权利。违反条款时，本许可证授予你的权利自动终止；你必须停止未经授权的
使用和分发。恢复授权或获得额外许可需要相关权利人的书面同意。

7. 无担保
在适用法律允许的范围内，本作品按“原样”提供，不附带适销性、特定用途适用性、
不侵权或其他明示或默示担保。权利人及贡献者不对使用或无法使用本作品造成的
损失承担责任。本条不排除适用法律规定不得排除的担保或责任。

8. 语言
中文为正式条款，以下英文为对应译文；两者不一致时以中文条款为准。
额外授权请求请通过项目维护者的公开联系方式或项目仓库提出。

English translation
===================

1. Scope
This license covers Lychee Talent code, documentation and original assets made available
under it (the "Work"), only to the extent the rights holders can grant these rights.
Files with separate terms, third-party materials and game-publisher content retain
their own terms and are not relicensed by this license. This license does not revoke
rights already lawfully obtained under another license. Non-waivable statutory
rights remain unaffected.

2. Free use and private modification
Subject to these terms, you receive a royalty-free, non-exclusive permission to
download, run, copy and study the Work for non-commercial purposes, and modify it
for personal, non-commercial use. Except under sections 3 and 5, no right to publicly
release, distribute or provide modified versions or derivative works is granted.

3. Complete, unchanged redistribution
You may redistribute complete, unchanged official source or the official addon
installation directory, free of charge and non-commercially. You may also include
the complete, unchanged addon in a free, non-commercial addon collection. Changes
to compression format or the enclosing directory are not modifications, provided
that you meet all of the following conditions:
  a. Keep the Lychee Talent / 荔枝天赋 name, authorship, copyright and license notices.
  b. Include this entire license and all applicable third-party notices.
  c. Prominently credit the project on the distribution page, collection description
     or another place readily visible to recipients:
     "Lychee Talent — Follen · https://github.com/Follen/LycheeTalent",
     or its Chinese equivalent:
     "Lychee Talent（荔枝天赋）— Follen · https://github.com/Follen/LycheeTalent".
  d. Do not charge for the addon, its download, access, or a collection containing it.
  e. Do not imply that the distributor is the original author, an official
     maintainer, or endorsed by the author.

4. No commercial use or misrepresentation
Without prior written permission from the applicable rights holders, you must not
use, copy, modify or distribute the Work for commercial purposes, including paid
addons or collections, subscriptions, paid access, paid services delivering the
Work, or advertising monetization tied to its distribution.
Do not remove or alter authorship, copyright, license or source information, or
present the Work or derivatives copying its copyright-protected material as your
own independently original work. Renaming, rebranding or minor code changes do
not remove these obligations. Extracting copyright-protected portions to evade
these terms is prohibited.
Except under section 5, publicly releasing modified versions, ports or derivative
works requires prior written permission, even if the release is free and credited.

5. Contributions and independent Providers
Non-commercial forks, branches and patches published solely to propose improvements
to this project for the author's review may contain modifications. They must retain
this license and attribution, identify themselves as unofficial, mark modifications,
and must not be promoted or distributed as independent products or alternative
releases. This exception does not otherwise authorize modified releases.
Submit only material you have the right to license. By intentionally submitting an
original contribution for inclusion, you permit the project to use, modify and
distribute that contribution under this license. Contributors retain their copyright.
An independently written third-party addon that only calls the public Provider API
and does not copy copyright-protected material from the Work is not subject to this
license's distribution restrictions merely because it calls that API.

6. Reserved rights and termination
All rights not expressly granted are reserved by their respective holders. This
license does not grant trademark endorsement or a right to relicense the Work.
Permissions granted to you terminate automatically upon breach. You must stop
unauthorized use and distribution. Reinstatement or additional permissions require
written consent from the applicable rights holders.

7. No warranty
To the extent allowed by applicable law, the Work is provided "AS IS", without
express or implied warranties, including merchantability, fitness for a particular
purpose and non-infringement. Rights holders and contributors are not liable for
losses arising from use of, or inability to use, the Work. This section does not
exclude warranties or liability that applicable law does not allow to be excluded.

8. Language
The Chinese text is authoritative. This English translation is provided for
convenience; the Chinese text prevails in case of inconsistency. Requests for
additional permission may be submitted through the maintainer's public contact
channels or the project repository.
